  "_doc": "The campaign. A level is a short siege of a few waves; each wave is a list of groups 'kind*count@start/gap' (seconds) and an optional boss 'id@start'. mods: hp and speed multiply every enemy, armor adds to it, fire_resist cuts burning, gold multiplies kill gold. slots is how many defence slots the level opens (upgrades add more). prep is how many cards the player picks before the first wave (the between-wave cards start over every level). Levels unlock in order; reward goes to the treasury (a third of it on a replay). The endless mode does not use this file: it keeps the original 30-wave generator (scripts/waves.gd).",
